{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Let me cross over, pray, and see the good land.</b> Did Moses need this — to eat of its fruits or to be sated with its goodness? Rather, this is what it says: Israel were commanded many commandments that apply only in the land; therefore, let me cross over, pray, to fulfill the commandments." "<b>And the Lebanon.</b> The Temple, which was made from the cedars of Lebanon."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:30.081264677Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}